FaceEmbedding.mlpackage

This model is derived from "face_recognition_sface_2021dec.onnx" from OpenCV Zoo:
  https://github.com/opencv/opencv_zoo/tree/main/models/face_recognition_sface
  SHA-256 of the original file:
  0ba9fbfa01b5270c96627c4ef784da859931e02f04419c829e83484087c34e79

The original file is licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0:
  https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0

Modifications (this repository): converted from ONNX to Core ML (.mlpackage) with
onnx2torch and coremltools by Models/convert_sface.py. The weights were not retrained
or altered; the converted model's output matches the original (cosine similarity 1.000000
on the test input). Input preprocessing (5-point alignment to 112x112) is done by
FaceIDCore before the model is called.

SFace: Zhong, Y. et al., "SFace: Sigmoid-Constrained Hypersphere Loss for Robust
Face Recognition" — https://github.com/zhongyy/SFace

The training data of the original model may carry its own terms; check the upstream
project before commercial use.
